p here  okay now that move that I said before  you're going to have to perform that and  you could do it one of two ways you can  do it so that you start with this corner  piece and you bring it this way or you  could do it so that you start with this  corner piece and bring it this way it  doesn't really matter so I'm going to  start I like to have it on the right  side so you do the move you go right  clockwise top 180 and right back down  and as you see what that does is it  makes this one now it has a white color  on the side so now you do the same thing  as before you look at the other color on  the side with the white in this case  it's green you match it up with its  center hold that Center and you go up  with that piece bring it towards you and  bring it back down also it's also like I  said before right side clockwise top  side clockwise right side  counterclockwise and there is one corner  left that we need to fix and when you're  doing the last corner you have to look  on the bottom because there is a open  but here what you need to do is you need  to put it so that this corner piece with  the white on it is directly below that  spot and if you don't what what will  happen is when you do that move to try  to fix this it will mess up this corner  that you had already placed it will mess  that up so you want to directly put this  piece directly above this empty spot  like so now it's directly above that  empty spot and you can perform that  other than the move again which which  fixes these corner pieces that have the  white on top it's up 180 and back down  then what you do now that this is fixed  you look at the other color again on the  side which is red match it with its  Center diagonally hold the center you go  up bring the white towards you so that  you match it with the other whites and  then you bring the whole side again back  down now you have the whole entire  bottom completed and as you'll see if  you turn the cue upside down you have  these color tees this one's green this  one's red this one's blue don't pay  attention to these edge pieces and this  one's orange and that completes the  second step of solving the puzzle
 

